{"id":"b5ecdf917f015f32","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-smn-lemma.md","title":"S-m-n Lemma","display":"lem-smn-lemma — S-m-n Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-smn-lemma","aliases":["88-lem-smn-lemma"],"display":"lem-smn-lemma — S-m-n Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-smn-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-smn-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-smn-lemma — S-m-n Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(r)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(r)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n^m\">\\(s_n^m\\)</span> 为候选参数固化函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a>。</li>\n<li>部分函数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a> 解释为图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\vec x,\\vec y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\vec x,\\vec y\\rangle\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m+n)\">\\((m+n)\\)</span> 元函数的输入位置表示长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+n\">\\(m+n\\)</span> 的拼接元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为函数值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smn\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\\to\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\vec y,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\langle\\langle\\vec x,\\vec y\\rangle,z\\rangle\n\\in\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smn\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\\to\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\vec y,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\langle\\langle\\vec x,\\vec y\\rangle,z\\rangle\n\\in\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右侧是在第一个参数块上取截面的部分函数图，不使用任何额外的函数抽象演算。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}\\)</span> 中逐点的 Kleene 等式，两图包含完全相同的输入—输出对；发散输入在两图中都没有值。因此普通集合相等足够，且没有把未定义的点值当作普通项比较。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+$；$\\varphi_e^{(r)}$ 见 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s_n^m$ 为候选参数固化函数；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"部分函数按 [[88-df-partial-function]] 解释为图；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"部分函数按 [[88-df-partial-function]] 解释为图；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"s_n^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\vec x,\\vec y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(m+n)","display":false},{"tex":"m+n","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smn\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\\to\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\vec y,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\langle\\langle\\vec x,\\vec y\\rangle,z\\rangle\n\\in\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}","display":false}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["1eb79833a139e232","b955b7851c500bfe","5f7e8cd4c12441fb","d585cbf989199162"]}